// A visual score with no sound: a 32-bar arrangement for the Visualiser
// to play over whatever the decks are doing (follow deck A or B).
// Scenes change on phrase lines; intensity builds with a saw over each
// 8-bar phrase; feedback swells; hue walks the wheel slowly.
// Safe: visuals only. Load it, then `omarchy-patch pattern follow a`.
cycle 4
scene("<nebula cells lattice prism>/8")
visual.intensity(saw.range(0.2, 1).slow(8).segment(16))
visual.feedback(sine.range(0.2, 0.9).slow(16).segment(8))
visual.symmetry("<0.2 0.4 0.6 0.9>/8")
visual.motion(tri.range(0.1, 0.7).slow(4).segment(8))
visual.hue(saw.slow(32).segment(4))
